  "final_answer": "All 3 tests pass. Fixed two bugs in pager.py:\n\n1. `paginate`: offset was `page * per_page` (0-based), which skipped the first page \u2014 changed to `(page - 1) * per_page` for correct 1-based paging.\n2. `page_count`: used floor division `total // per_page` \u2014 changed to `(total + per_page - 1) // per_page` to round up (still returns 0 for 0 items).",
